    {
      "subId": "7165407",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "716540701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "716540701": {
            "id": "716540701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Well! It seems that we have a visitor... Oh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540702"
            ]
          },
          "716540702": {
            "id": "716540702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, it's Tubby! From a distance, Paimon thought it was just a huge finch!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540703"
            ]
          },
          "716540703": {
            "id": "716540703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So you're the \"little helper\" Madame Ping mentioned?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540704"
            ]
          },
          "716540704": {
            "id": "716540704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Madame Ping... Oh, you must mean Ping! Yes, she did summon me here. She told me much about you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540705"
            ]
          },
          "716540705": {
            "id": "716540705",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "You know, back when we met in the Mondstadt tavern, I had a feeling that we would meet again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540706"
            ]
          },
          "716540706": {
            "id": "716540706",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "It seems I was right. But it's still a nice surprise to meet you here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540707"
            ]
          },
          "716540707": {
            "id": "716540707",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "You may leave all matters regarding the upkeep of this realm to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540708"
            ]
          },
          "716540708": {
            "id": "716540708",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Your journey may be far from over... but at least this way, you will not want for a comfortable place to sleep each night.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540709"
            ]
          },
          "716540709": {
            "id": "716540709",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, what's a teapot spirit, exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540710"
            ]
          },
          "716540710": {
            "id": "716540710",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Though it is the adepti who create realms such as this, they generally do not have the time of day to attend to the banal matter of their maintenance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540711"
            ]
          },
          "716540711": {
            "id": "716540711",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Thus, we teapot spirits were created to help guard their realms and manage their affairs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540712"
            ]
          },
          "716540712": {
            "id": "716540712",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "You may consider me a butler, if you will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540713"
            ]
          },
          "716540713": {
            "id": "716540713",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Now, allow me to explain this realm to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540714"
            ]
          },
          "716540714": {
            "id": "716540714",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Have you any blueprints on you? Specifically, blueprints with beautiful rooms, chairs, and the like.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540715"
            ]
          },
          "716540715": {
            "id": "716540715",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "As long as you have a blueprint, you can refashion this realm however you please.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540716"
            ]
          },
          "716540716": {
            "id": "716540716",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Blueprints? Oh, that's right! Granny handed us some when she gave us the teapot, didn't she? Let's take them out and have a look!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540717"
            ]
          },
          "716540717": {
            "id": "716540717",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Yes, these are the blueprints I'm talking about. Go on, open them up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540718"
            ]
          },
          "716540718": {
            "id": "716540718",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Just commit the image of the objects to memory and prepare the necessary materials...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540719"
            ]
          },
          "716540719": {
            "id": "716540719",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Then, simply release the thought from your mind and the object in the blueprint shall appear within this teapot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540720"
            ]
          },
          "716540720": {
            "id": "716540720",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, is that all it takes? Then... we could build a whole city inside, couldn't we!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540721"
            ]
          },
          "716540721": {
            "id": "716540721",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Hmm... I doubt it. A golden-eyed adeptus explained this to me at some point in the past.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540722"
            ]
          },
          "716540722": {
            "id": "716540722",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "He said that even though Sub-Space Creation is a product of adeptal power, even that has its limits.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540723"
            ]
          },
          "716540723": {
            "id": "716540723",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "This world is not a true one, after all. It provides merely a moment of brief respite from the mortal realm, not a means of escaping it entirely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540724"
            ]
          },
          "716540724": {
            "id": "716540724",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A golden-eyed adeptus? Paimon wonders — who could that be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540725"
            ]
          },
          "716540725": {
            "id": "716540725",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "I hardly remember myself. What's more, I have never seen that adeptus again since...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540726"
            ]
          },
          "716540726": {
            "id": "716540726",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How very strange...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540727"
            ]
          },
          "716540727": {
            "id": "716540727",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "Well, let's not dwell on that. Have a look around — best you get accustomed to this realm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716540728"
            ]
          },
          "716540728": {
            "id": "716540728",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Tubby",
            "text": "If there's anything you would like to ask, just look for me."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}